baseline = "Not executed: the task's explicit gate order forbids builds or tests before the complete implementation and permits verification only through hf-done. No pre-change test failures are claimed."
evidence = "The runner's hf-build/hf-done ledger records the exact candidate revision, command, exit code and private log location; qualification requires both gates on the same candidate."
